{title: I Gave My Life for Thee}
{artist: Frances Havergal & Philip Bliss}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 72}

Verse 1
I [F]gave my life for [Bb]thee; my [F]precious blood I [C]shed,
that [F]thou might'st ransomed [Bb]be, and [F]quickened [C]from the [F]dead.
I gave, I gave my [Bb]life for thee — [F]what hast thou [C]given for [F]me?
